Comment: 9,0:23:34.89,0:23:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's that guy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Jolyne Kujo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.28,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not Lang Rangler!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.91,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he fail?\NIs she getting the disc in his place?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.33,0:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a few minutes,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.71,0:00:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}her ally will come\Nto retrieve the disc in the courtyard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.17,0:00:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the prison chaplain.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She knows who I am.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.05,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, she would have attacked me already\Nif she knew I was her enemy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.35,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Please, Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't set off the alarm!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.19,0:00:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause any trouble!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.11,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would be easy to knock him out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.28,0:00:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would be nothing at all.\NMy father's life is at stake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All I have to do is strike him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already caused trouble.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.70,0:00:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You unlocked this door\Nwith someone else's work permit.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:00.50,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the holder of that permit,\Ninmate Lang Rangler?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know me,
Dialogue: 9,0:01:08.39,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't expect\Nyou to believe me.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not lying to you, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:12.81,0:01:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That inmate attacked me.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:15.85,0:01:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:17.77,0:01:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's unconscious\Nin one of the laundry baskets.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:21.27,0:01:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I must report\Nthis incident to the authorities.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:27.78,0:01:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be glad to cooperate\Nonce I'm back from the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:30.87,0:01:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need two minutes...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just one minute,\NFather, please.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get to the courtyard.\NThat's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:39.95,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to pretend\NI didn't see anything?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:43.25,0:01:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's life and soul depend on it.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:48.59,0:01:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A man of God must understand that.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come here alone?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else with you?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:57.06,0:01:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I came alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:59.77,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lied to the chaplain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:02.19,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's for a good cause,\Nit shouldn't have any consequences.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:05.65,0:02:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I can't tell him about the disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:08.61,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need one minute.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:11.74,0:02:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing someone a favor
Dialogue: 9,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,means expecting\Nsomething in return.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:18.62,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You want people to be kind to you,\Nthat's why you're kind.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Unconditional love doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:25.71,0:02:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unconditional love
Dialogue: 9,0:02:28.29,0:02:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is only granted\Nto those who reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:32.05,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend\NI never saw you here.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,However, as you suggested,\Nyou'll only have one minute.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:40.69,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be back at this door\Nwithin one minute.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:48.48,0:02:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone is hiding behind that jerry can.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.44,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she has an ally,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.99,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd better not reveal{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:56.87,0:03:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that I'm Whitesnake's user\Nby finishing off Jolyne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Speedwagon Foundation's agent\Ntold me{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that the person\NI'm supposed to give the disc to{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.18,0:03:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}would identify themselves\Nas soon as I reached the courtyard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.22,0:03:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:24.81,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,where's your pass?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:35.07,0:03:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have one, it seems.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.41,0:03:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being charged with attempted escape.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:39.91,0:03:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? What happened?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.62,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never considered\Nsetting off the alarm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made the right call,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:47.92,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had a guard posted\Nto watch the courtyard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was in 1988.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I had befriended a man,\Nan Egyptian{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:38.28,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who claimed to have the power\Nto stop time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.03,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That day, he suddenly told me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.16,0:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be possible\Nto reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.66,0:05:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was young and handsome,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.38,0:05:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he carried himself like a man\Nwho had lived for centuries.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the time, I was 16.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was still studying.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.55,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sad.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.47,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about death.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.31,0:06:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The heaven I speak of
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,concerns the soul.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the place our soul goes.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of our soul\Nsurely evolves there.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the final form of our souls.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you, in particular,\Nare capable of understanding this.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,True happiness lies there.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But to get there,\Nyou must reach heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.41,0:06:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness isn't achieved
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,by having the strongest body,\Npiles of money
Dialogue: 9,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,or dominating others.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,True victory
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,belongs to those who have seen heaven.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.93,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do anything to reach that goal.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.27,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've written everything in a notebook.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.90,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to Egypt sometime.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.19,0:07:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need your help
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to test my theory.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.86,0:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sadly,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}before I could learn his methods...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.25,0:07:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the notebook was burned to ashes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The man who burned it\Nwas Jolyne Kujo's father,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.55,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jotaro Kujo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:23.80,0:07:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jotaro read the notebook's contents.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then he sealed its contents for eternity{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}along with the soul of Dio Brando,\Nwho sought to reach heaven.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I then waited over 20 years{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to gain access\Nto Jotaro Kujo's memory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The notebook's contents are stored there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:49.07,0:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I finally obtained his memory{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:53.58,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}along with Star Platinum, which defeated Dio.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, Jotaro's body is rotting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.04,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Although his daughter has acted\Nunpredictably in this prison,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:06.80,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my plan is back on track.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's been shot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone shot Jolyne!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who? A guard?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.64,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or did our enemy\Nget wind of our plan{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.15,0:08:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with Whitesnake hiding somewhere?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.58,0:08:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guard will retrieve Star Platinum.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.79,0:08:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing left for me to do here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm heading back to the chapel.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.60,0:08:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.43,0:08:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ordered to retrieve this disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:55.68,0:09:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He also ordered me\Nto finish off this girl.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.15,0:09:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But who gave me that order?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:12.74,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway. I was ordered
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.66,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,to blow her brains out.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.67,0:09:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing I can do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.29,0:09:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't help her anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.18,0:09:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life ends here,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My Stand, Weather Report,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,manipulates the weather.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:57.66,0:10:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's what I do best.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jolyne,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:02.67,0:10:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may be unable to save you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I can still protect the disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:07.71,0:10:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you still have the resolve,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you might just make it out alive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.93,0:10:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Between 1887 and 1974,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.69,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there were over 50 cases of rains\Nof frogs, fish or sheep{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}falling from the sky{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.24,0:10:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}onto Florida, in the United States.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.32,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The cause of these animal rains\Nis attributed to tornadoes and cyclones.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These frogs are venomous{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:41.00,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and they live in the trees\Nof Central and South America.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:45.79,0:10:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The poison produced under their skin\Nis so toxic{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that the natives\Ndip their arrows in it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are these damn frogs coming from?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,These frogs,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:09.53,0:11:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they're poison dart frogs,\Nknown for their toxicity, I believe.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.45,0:11:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once their poison enters the body,\Nit only takes a few seconds{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.78,0:11:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to stop blood circulation\Nand breathing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now they're spraying\Ntheir fluids everywhere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whitesnake!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That power...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:26.25,0:11:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be him?\NThe one who controls the weather?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Weather Report.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The one with no memory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could he be the one hiding\Nbehind the jerry can?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good Lord,\NI can't touch the badge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These frogs are toxic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was I shot?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do my wounds look like?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:11.75,0:12:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The poison!\NIt's getting through my fibers!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.76,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone open this door!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.85,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:22.35,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay calm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.93,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep your cool.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do in this situation?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.69,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, three, five.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.90,0:12:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay calm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.86,0:12:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.90,0:12:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prime numbers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:35.11,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleven.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:36.24,0:12:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These lonely numbers\Nonly divisible by themselves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:41.16,0:12:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Counting them calms me\Nand gives me strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.99,0:12:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-three.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.58,0:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-eight.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, 29.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good Lord.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:50.17,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These amphibians are staining\Nmy 800-dollar pants!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Weather Report is in the laundry room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's too far.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't stop\Nthis downpour of frogs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to flee.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-one.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, that's right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:06.77,0:13:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guard in the courtyard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.44,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's still under my control\Nthanks to the disc. Where is he?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.15,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.57,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to come back!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:23.62,0:13:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.33,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask God to help me, please!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.04,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-three.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:31.21,0:13:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-seven.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.71,0:13:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-three.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-nine.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.70,TiretsDefault,,616,0,0,,– {\i1}This poison is super potent.{\i0}\N– Sixty-one.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.26,0:13:42.84,TiretsDefault,,597,0,0,,– Tell God to save me!\N– So you can hear me after all.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.93,0:13:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your badge!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:45.85,0:13:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to make it?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.31,0:13:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out now!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:53.40,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-seven.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.91,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-one.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These frogs...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:10.08,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Open this door immediately!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.96,TiretsDefault,,463,0,0,,– What's going on?\N– How should I know! A tornado?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, will you!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.97,0:14:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.89,0:14:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opening.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.22,0:14:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These frogs, they...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.39,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A guard lost consciousness on this side.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, open up!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.52,0:14:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An unconscious guard?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.86,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get help!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.49,0:14:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Open this door!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.07,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need authorization, don't I?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:49.04,0:14:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask my supervisor.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.08,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. Calm down, Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am very calm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.38,0:14:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're the one...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.05,0:14:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seventy-three.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seventy-nine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:00.38,0:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... who's panicking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:02.09,0:15:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You dare abandon me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.43,0:15:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a disc!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may not have an army to command,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.90,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I can control a frog.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Explode after leaping ten meters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I command it!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.41,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me. Father, call for help!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.79,0:15:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:37.00,0:15:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,have mercy!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighty-three.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighty-nine.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninety-seven.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.34,0:15:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.97,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that if I could get through this door,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.35,0:15:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heal you immediately,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.68,0:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.52,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come toward my voice.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.53,0:16:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.66,0:16:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo's Star Platinum disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do with it?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken out Jolyne Kujo,\Nbut I can't leave her alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:18.05,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is open.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me somewhere safe, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Father?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm out of string.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't protect myself from the poison anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.31,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The disc I dropped,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know where it is now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain has stopped.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.79,0:16:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Jolyne Kujo's corpse?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.46,0:17:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The disc can't be far.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was tough,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.05,0:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but my Snake can't\Nbe beaten by frogs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.59,0:17:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Find it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.68,0:17:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whitesnake has a range\Nof 20 meters at most.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.35,0:17:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It would be a serious problem\Nif someone saw me here,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I have no choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirits of dead criminals
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.07,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,take the form of frogs\Nand return to this world
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.99,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to look for companions.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:34.41,0:17:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an oriental legend\NI once heard.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.83,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it describe\Nthis monstrous scene perfectly?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:41.67,0:17:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And the disc is near the body.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:46.04,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.92,0:17:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Search toward the door.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.01,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard might have had it on him.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.47,0:17:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be in that direction.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:58.47,0:17:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the disc back.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.57,0:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you to find it.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.63,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They disgust me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:23.46,0:18:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're stuck all over me,\NI feel like throwing up.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.09,0:18:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Frogs only release their poison\Nwhen they hit the ground.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.01,0:18:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Unharmed, they're harmless.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.47,0:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I built a carpet\Nof live frogs
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.89,0:18:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to cushion the fall\Nof the other frogs
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.81,0:18:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and I waited\Nfor you to find the disc.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic attempt!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:47.48,0:18:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you, bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He was already here.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.45,0:19:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the Speedwagon Foundation's\Nagent.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't human,
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.67,0:19:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was right on time.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.84,0:19:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He slipped between the frogs\Nand reached the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That pigeon's name is Savage Garden.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:17.22,0:19:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A carrier pigeon trained\Nto bring the disc to its destination.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.77,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whitesnake!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.98,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guard's gun, near the door!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:28.57,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kill that pigeon!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What a moron, that guard!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He fired all his bullets!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.66,0:19:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.49,0:19:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with Star Platinum,\Nyour dear daddy is just a mummy!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.09,0:19:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't even remember his own daughter!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.47,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! A guard is down!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.14,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't step on the frogs!\NSearch the courtyard!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be someone out there!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whatever happens, don't pass out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Its user must be nearby.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.98,0:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to find\NWhitesnake's user.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.37,0:20:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the one who has\Nmy father's memory disc.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.20,0:20:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To find Whitesnake's user,\Nit's now or never!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:25.00,0:20:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look out the window!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.50,0:20:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!\NIt has to be a miracle!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's going to clean all this up?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The game hasn't turned.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.05,0:20:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only took Star Platinum{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.01,0:20:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because of my promise\Nto avenge my friend Dio.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.64,0:20:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's the memory disc that matters,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and that one, I have it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:48.48,0:20:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything is going smoothly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only Jotaro's memory{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.65,0:20:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}contains the clues\Nto reach heaven.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.24,0:21:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A supernatural phenomenon\Nmade it rain frogs{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.46,0:21:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}inside the prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With all this,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:15.59,0:21:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jolyne's escape attempt\Nwent unnoticed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.97,0:21:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The disc containing Star Platinum,\NJotaro Kujo's Stand,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:26.35,0:21:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was delivered to the Speedwagon Foundation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:29.23,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.19,0:21:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}without the memory disc,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.69,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jotaro's soul\Nwon't return to its body.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:23:09.62,0:23:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Max,
Dialogue: 9,0:23:11.62,0:23:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,about this bone,
Dialogue: 9,0:23:15.08,0:23:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to do\Nsomething to it.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:19.79,0:23:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a human bone?
Dialogue: 9,0:23:22.72,0:23:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does it belong to?
Dialogue: 9,0:23:24.01,0:23:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't concern you.
